  "description": ".NET for iOS / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog iOS SDK's DatadogCrashReporting framework: captures native crashes and reports them as RUM errors on the next launch. From dd-sdk-ios 3.0 the crash engine is KSCrash, linked into this framework, so there is no separate CrashReporter package any more. Built against dd-sdk-ios 3.14.0. Enable it after initializing the SDK; upload your app's dSYMs to Datadog for symbolication.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
